  "notes": [
    "The four captures share two named portal CREATEs. The source and installed portal visual agree. Paired telepads 1027 and 1028 supply headings and arrival coordinates. For the exterior return, the first stable player position after arrival fits the installed collision mesh.",
    "Repeated CREATE positions with different source IIDs identify respawn homes. Each home is counted once. The main capture contains two visits. Groups contain only neighboring actors observed together in the same cell; other homes are point spawners.",
    "Revenant Legionary maps by treasure profile 774 and the Asmolum quest kill effect. Revenant Prefect maps by treasure profile 780. Other same-name variants have profiles 1259 and 1260. Ossein is a unique named monster with profile 1160 and the Servant of the Bones completion effect in both builds.",
    "Gurog Captain's exact native variant is unresolved. The Trove and its encounter gates are withheld pending supported interaction evidence.",
    "AC2 Hero's Kill Ossein guide identifies one randomly appearing Servant of the Bones near the Ossuary. The three outdoor approach areas west and southwest of the captured portal are inferred. Ground, body, and separation are checked against the installed DAT and existing placements. Each lifetime occupies one randomly chosen home. The refill uses the emulator creature policy."
  ],
